    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23929" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δεκέλεια</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έη, ἡ,</span> a
		place in Attica, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
		</span></i>, etc.:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δεκελεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a Decelean,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.73
			</span></i>; but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δεκελειεύς</span></b> 
			Inscrr. 
				Att.
			, as <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.660
			</span></i>, al.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκα-εεύς</span></b>  ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.1247
			</span></i>, al.: Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δεκελεικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
				<i>Decclean,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Δ. πόλεμος,</span> name given to the
			latter part of the Pelop. war, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.37
			</span></i>, etc. Advbs. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δεκελεῆθεν</span></b> 
			<i>from D.,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l. c.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκα-ειόθεν</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				23.2
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δεκελείᾱσιν</span></b> 
			<i>at D.,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.84
			</span></i>:</div>
